<!--
  The mark at small size — 12 edges instead of 30.

  The same projection, reduced to the silhouette plus the two inner triangles
  that give it its character. Thirty edges inside 16 dp turn to mush; this stays
  a shape. Every logo that survives small has a version like this.

  Vertices are taken straight from the full mark, so the two are the same figure
  and never drift apart.
-->
